#passage(("These people in those airplane that are calling upon Ya Ali, those people are worse than the pagan Arabs. They're worse than the Kuffar of Quraysh. Do you know why? Allah Azza wa Jalla, when he spoke about the Kuffar of Quraysh, what did he say? He said, \"Fa idhā rakibū fil-fulki daʿawullāha mukhliṣīna lahu d-dīn. Falammā najjāhum ilal-barri idhā hum yushrikūn.\" Pagan Arabs, if they are in the sea, they will call upon Allah Azza wa Jalla alone. If there is a calamity in the sea, they're about to drown, the waves are like mountains, they call upon Allah Azza wa Jalla alone. So, when Allah gives them safety and they are on the shore, they start committing shirk. So, those Kuffar of Quraysh, in times of difficulty, they call upon Allah alone. But those Shia mushrikin, they call upon Ali in times of difficulty. So, the Kuffar of Quraysh are better than them.", "Allah also says in the Quran, \"Wa idhā massakumu ḍ-ḍurru fil-baḥri ḍalla man tadʿūna illā iyyāh. Falammā najjākum ilal-barri aʿraḍtum wa kānal-insānu kafūrā.\" If calamity happens to you in the sea, you forget everyone that you call upon except Allah. So, you call upon Allah alone. But when Allah takes you to safety to the shore, you become kafūr, you become a disbeliever, disobedient, and ungrateful person, and you associate with Allah Azza wa Jalla. Also in the Quran, Allah tells the prophet to say to the pagan Arabs, \"Qul ara'aytukum in atākum\": \"What if the punishment of Allah Azza Wajal comes to you or the day of judgement comes? Would you call other than Allah if you are truthful? Rather, you will call upon him. That you will call upon Allah Azza Wajal and you will forget all of these things that you are associating with Allah.\"",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Jewish Rabbi Gives Shia A Lesson In Tawheed | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fs2F2-5ZYWg", ((157, "2:37–3:24"), (204, "3:24–4:15"),), id: 566)
