#passage(("This is a warning to the Prophet Muhammad S.A.W.: Indeed, it was revealed to you and those who came before you, i.e. all the prophets of God: If you associate with Allah, all your deeds are gone. And you will be among the losers in the hereafter. Allah Azza Wajjal is addressing the messenger, the best of mankind.", "You call upon Ali, he can't hear you. He's in Barzakh, being rewarded. He has no idea what's going on in your life. Ali will be your enemy in the day of judgement. He'll tell you: I never knew you, stay away from me, you evil mushrik. I call upon Allah.", "That's why Ali, when the first Shias kind of were worshipping him, they started bowing down to him. He burned them. Of course it's haram to burn anybody. That's why he was advised by the Sahaba, and Sahaba told him the prophet said only Allah would burn people. The lord of fire is the only one who burns with fire. However, he did that to them because it was so grave that they started worshipping him. It was so crazy that he burned them. Alive.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Jewish Rabbi Gives Shia A Lesson In Tawheed | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fs2F2-5ZYWg", ((638, "10:38–11:01"), (697, "11:37–12:05"), (728, "12:08–12:37"),), id: 568)
