#passage(("You see this Jewish rabbi making fun of them. But the Jewish people, they worship their rabbis. Allah Azza Wajal says, \"Min duni Allah\": they took the rabbis and priests as gods beside Allah. You have many Jewish people that worship the rabbis as well. These people is making it seem as if you have polytheists among the Muslims only. No, you have polytheists among your ranks. But he's right. You have those people among our ranks that deify other than Allah. And by the way, it's not just the Shia. There's many communities that have this: Barelvis, and then you have some Sufis. You have this and that that go call upon the dead. They call upon the dead to give them rizq. They call upon the dead to help them in the time of difficulty and calamity. They are no different in their action than those people in the airplane. They're associating with Allah in their worship.", "And now we need a Jewish rabbi to teach us tawhid. We've come at the day and age where a Jewish rabbi is going to teach the muwahhidun, the people of Qur'an and Sunnah, because of those Shias and the people like them that associate with Allah, worship other than Allah. And whenever they're corrected, of course, people start attacking you. When you say to worship Allah alone, they don't like it. And Allah says that in the Qur'an, that if you mention Allah alone, then they turn away from you. But if you mention other than Allah, they're happy. They're rejoicing. They want to listen. They open their ears to you.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Jewish Rabbi Gives Shia A Lesson In Tawheed | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fs2F2-5ZYWg", ((342, "5:42–6:32"), (392, "6:32–7:06"),), id: 569)
