#passage(("External actions reflect internal beliefs. That's always the case! If you love someone, you'll behave like you love them. When they're in need, you're going to help them. The actions show everything. That's why, when people get married, every day he says to his wife, or she says to him, \"I love you\", and then they're fighting every two minutes! They have issues. You can say words, but is it really manifested in the behaviour and actions you're taking with the other individual? That's the true testimony of the faith.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Surprises Muslim With Unusual Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cluCTYA-UgM", ((540, "9:00–9:25"),), id: 597)
