#passage(("If you disagree with any part of the Quran, and you say you don't believe in that thing: it's not up to the time, it's not up to the standards, it's not just, it's not fair, or the Prophetﷺ was wrong about this specific thing, this disqualifies the person from being a Muslim. A Muslim, the definition of the word means \"Submitter\", someone who submits to the Revelation. He submits to Allahﷻ; he submits to the Messenger and the teachings of Allahﷻ and His Messengerﷺ.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “American Lady Questions Muslim About Women In Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wloKwQx2KcA", ((36, "0:36–0:59"),), id: 598)
