#passage(("He said it in أساس التقديس, which is a very well-known book of Fakhr al-Razi, page 221. He says: “أما الأدلة العقلية فإذا تعارضت مع الأدلة النقلية, إما أن يقال أنّها غير صحيحة او يقال إنها صحيحة إلا أن المراد منها غير ظواهرها. ثم إن جوّزنا التأويل: اشتغلنا به على سبيل التبرع بذكر تلك التأويلات على التفصيل. وإن لم نجوّز التأويل فوضنا العلم بها إلى الله تعالى. فهذا هو القانون الكُلّي المرجوع إليه في جميع المتشابهات. وبالله التوفيق”", "Open the book: الفصل الحادي والثلاثون (Chapter:31). There are different chapters. He says كلام كُلّي في أخبار الآحاد, a general speech regarding the news of the Ahaad (singular narrator), which is 95% of the Sunnah according to Ibn Hajar Al Asqalani.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Aggressive Ashari Interrogates Muhammed Ali On Stream!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k7SGfzzryjY", ((680, "11:20–12:01"), (740, "12:20–12:33"),), id: 613)
// U ML354:641-685 | The Muslim Lantern | 4
#passage(("I personally believe that Ibn Hajar Al Asqalani was an Ashari in عقيدة and I believe that he had many أصول, many principles of Ashairah which he disagreed with. So he wasn’t 100% on their principles. For example, the principle that I just told you of al-Razi, which is putting the intellect over text or rejecting آحاد Hadith, Ibn Hajar Al Asqalani disagrees with.", "If you go to فتح الباري (Grant of the Creator), his book on صحيح البخاري, and you go to باب الاعتصام بالكتاب والسنة (the chapter of holding onto the Quran and the Sunnah), he quotes Ibn 'Abd al-Barr رحمة الله, the great imam of the Malikis. He quotes his statement that, if an authentic Hadith comes to us, we cannot reject it. This goes against this principle of al-Razi, which is set in the Ashari مذهب (school of thought), that the intellect precedes the text when it comes to آحاد Hadith and all of that.", "You’ll find al-Ghazali says that in قانون التأويل. You’ll find that al-Juwayni says that in الإرشاد. You’ll find the Imams, quote-unquote, of these مذاهب having that. And they took that [from] the معتزلة (al-Mu'tazila), from Al-Qadi Abd al-Jabbar.", "When I was reading the books of al-Razi and al-Juwayni – because I studied their books in university – when I was reading what they said, that is the reason that made me certain that those people are not from أهل السنة, because they reject the Sunnah. And they say, “We don't accept آحاد in عقيدة” (We don't accept آحاد Hadith in creed).",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Aggressive Ashari Interrogates Muhammed Ali On Stream!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k7SGfzzryjY", ((1179, "19:39–19:49"), (1198, "19:58–20:17"), (1225, "20:25–20:34"), (1273, "21:13–21:28"),), id: 614)
