#passage(("Angel Gabriel is a Creation of God like other Angels. We believe Angels are a different Creation. The Angels in Islam are created from light. Humans are not created from light. The Angels of God do not disobey The Creator, which means they obey Him in every command. They don't follow their desires, they follow the commands of The Creator. They worship God non-stop, we don't worship God non-stop. There are many differences between Angels and Humans.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Iceland Visitors Enquire About Islam! Muhammed Ali - Speakers Corner”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xigQO8G9dOo", ((329, "5:29–5:57"),), id: 620)
