#passage(("What are Angels? What is the description of an Angel according to Christians? According to Christians, an Angel is another creation that God made, but they're perfect, I guess, and they stay with Him in Heaven and they worship Him. So if they're perfect, how can one of them disobey God then?", "This is the same thing that we believe as Muslims! We believe that Angels are perfect beings. Allahﷻ says in the Quran (At-Tahrim66:6): لَّا يَعْصُونَ اللَّهَ مَا أَمَرَهُمْ وَيَفْعَلُونَ مَا يُؤْمَرُونَ. Allahﷻ says لَّا يَعْصُونَ اللَّهَ (They do not disobey Allahﷻ) مَا أَمَرَهُم (whatever He commands them, and they do as they're commanded). And Allahﷻ says (Alanbiya21:26-27): بَلْ عِبَادٌ مُّكْرَمُونَ. لَا يَسْبِقُونَهُ بِالْقَوْلِ وَهُم بِأَمْرِهِ يَعْمَلُونَ (But rather they are honoured servants. They do not precede Allahﷻ in speech). Meaning they don't speak over God, or they wait for the Command from God. And whatever God commands them to do, they do.", "These Angels are pure Creation from that sense: they worship God, they do good, from that sense of perfectness, which is a relative idea of perfectness. Therefore it becomes impossible for you to claim that Satan was an Angel, because Angels don't disobey God.", "So you see how these stories are always like this, inconsistent, ridiculous, and do not make any common sense. For example, you see the same thing in the story of Adam: Adam was perfect according to the Bible. How can you be perfect and then you disobey God and eat from the tree? It's either you're perfect or you're not perfect! And then how can God punish you, when you did not know right from wrong?", "It's like a small baby crying and he drops a glass of water, and then you go slap the baby! The baby is not conscious, not aware of what he's doing, he doesn't know right from wrong. How can you punish him for something? That's why we have laws: when you reach adulthood, then you're punished for specific acts that you do, when you reach the age first of تمييز (where you're able to distinguish things), like 12-13-14. But when a baby's 2-3 years old and he does something, only an idiot is going to go punish that baby, because we know that a baby's not able to differentiate between right and wrong.", "So all of these things that oppose Islam are irrational things. This is a claim I'm going to make now: every distinction that you find between Christianity and Islam that opposes the Islamic teachings is going to be something irrational. Anything, and you go find it.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Highlights The Inconsistency Of The Bible! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KcRdd8LsvKE", ((801, "13:21–13:42"), (828, "13:48–14:11"), (857, "14:17–14:23"), (870, "14:30–14:44"), (890, "14:50–15:18"), (921, "15:21–15:36"),), id: 621)
