#passage(("If I say, \"You have an old soul,\" is that a positive or a negative thing? This is the thing with all of these Astrology, Numerology, all of these things: they tell you positive things because you are more inclined to accept them and believe them. Even when they want to tell you something negative, they tell you something which is positive in reality: \"Oh, you're too nice that you give everyone too much stuff.\" When they want to tell you something negative about you: \"You're too nice that you don't say No too much to people.\" They're still telling you something positive, but they are wrapping it, pretending as if it's actually negative, not positive. So you're way more inclined to believe it, because humans have this ego, egotistical nature, that they're happy to hear anything good, beautiful, positive that is said about them.", "So in Islam, we believe this is the first time we are on earth for sure. So we were not on earth before; there's no reincarnation or anything like that. But there's a world that we were in, that Allah created us in before he put us in this life, where Allah created all the souls of humans. And Allah said to them (alA'raf7:172) to testify that Allah is our God. And that's why everyone has an innate belief, as many studies have already shown, like Justin Barrett in Oxford University, Oliver Petrovich… Many, many studies which showed that humans are innately born believing in a Creator.", "Now, there's an interesting narration, the Prophet Muhammadﷺ told us: (the souls that have met or known each other, in that time, they will have harmony in this life) (And the ones that didn't, they will have a form of repellent towards one another). So you can feel this closeness of souls between you and someone else, because in that world, before you came to this life, there was a form of knowing. You KNEW that other soul.", "So the Prophetﷺ said: (Bukhari:3336) فَمَا تَعَارَفَ مِنْهَا ائتَلَفَ، وَمَا تَنَاكَرَ مِنْهَا اخْتَلَفَ: whatever had known one another at that time, they have \"أُلفة Ulfah\"; they have this kind of Acceptance, Familiarity with one another, Easygoing with each other, etc. And the ones that didn't, اخْتَلَفَ; they disagree, they're more in disagreement with one another. It would give you a realistic thing, not that number 33 or number 44.", "So that past existence or world, it's not that we lived an entire life there or anything like that, but Allah created us, and all the souls of humanity were there at that time, and then they came into this life. Some scholars would refer to it as عالم الذر (World of tiny particles), because people were very small at that time, and ذر can refer to something that is the smallest thing; or also عالم الأرواح (the World of Spirits). They can use different references to it. There was an event where Allah placed all the souls in one place, souls of the creation, and he made them testify that Allah is our Lord. And then after that, we came into this life and we don't remember that. But that Hadith still tells us the effect that can happen in this life due to that.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Tyson Hockley Grills The Muslim Lantern With Difficult Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XGBP8LOEhg8", ((728, "12:08–12:58"), (781, "13:01–13:30"), (821, "13:41–14:03"), (848, "14:08–14:26"), (895, "14:55–15:39"),), id: 622)
