d38:79). He said: (Oh my Lord! give me until the day they are resurrected). Then Allah says you have been given a time (Sad38:81). So, he requested time. And then he said (In that time, I'm going to misguide as many as I can.) (Sad38:82).", "All of these are choices that Iblis is choosing to do on his own. He is choosing to disobey God. He's choosing to do evil. He is choosing on his own: \"So, you know what? I'm going to make this my life mission!\" \"I'm doomed because of my envy and arrogance.\" \"So, what I'm going to do now is I'm going to make it my life mission to take as many as I can from the progeny of this thing that I'm envious of, that I believe I'm better than.\" Doesn't that make perfect sense? Imagine I'm envious of you: I'm trying to destroy you and all your children and your life and your lineage and everything. So, he made it his life mission to try to take as many away from God, as many to Hellfire as he can, with him.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Truth Seeker Presents Muslim With Genuine Questions About Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fbAbWBPDY6M", ((320, "5:20–5:40"), (342, "5:42–6:05"), (369, "6:09–6:33"), (396, "6:36–6:53"), (431, "7:11–7:19"), (443, "7:23–7:44"), (469, "7:49–8:24"),), id: 633)
