#passage(("A Supernatural power created by Allah, what is the problem? Where is the evidence that the survey is saying that there are things other than Allah? All this hypothetical survey that you quoted says is that they believe in Magic, and believe in Magic is a part of the Islamic teachings. We do believe in Magic. We believe it's something that Allah created, and it is explicitly mentioned on the Quran in chapter 2: يُعَلِّمُونَ النَّاسَ السِّحْرَ وَمَا أُنزِلَ عَلَى الْمَلَكَيْنِ بِبَابِلَ هَارُوتَ وَمَارُوتَ ۚ (Quran2:102). Allah is saying يُعَلِّمُونَ النَّاسَ \"they teach the people\" السِّحْرَ \"Magic\". So سِحْرَ or magic is something that every Muslim has to believe in, because it's a part of the Quran.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Attempts To Mock Muslims Then Gets Caught! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gAyR4PsoXPg", ((696, "11:36–12:19"),), id: 636)
