#passage(("My thoughts is she didn't \"die\", because \"die\" is complete separation of soul and body. They don't come back to this life again. Whether it's organs stopped for a while or whatever happened to her, we don't consider that death. When the soul and the body completely separate, and then she goes to the grave, she's going to see the two angels that are going to come to her and question her. That's going to happen. But she didn't die yet. So her testimony means nothing, because she didn't die.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Grills Muslim With Difficult And Inquisitive Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eOPafAukvyc", ((177, "2:57–3:28"),), id: 651)
// U ML099:54-107 | The Muslim Lantern | 5
#passage(("There is a process. What happens to you, from the moment you die till the moment you either end up in Hellfire or Heaven, is explicitly mentioned in Islam. The Prophet Muhammad told us that when the person is about to die, the Angel of Death comes to you. The Angel of Death is an angel. And then he comes with a group of other angels. Now, this group of other angels, who they are and what they will bring with them, is dependent on the person: if that person is a believer, or is he a disbeliever.", "If the person is a believer, the angels will come with a white cloth that has the scent of musk, a beautiful scent from Heaven. And then, when the soul of the believer will be taken out of his body, it will be very smooth, like a drop of water. So, it's not going to be a painful process. And then they will take that soul of that person. And then his soul will be taken up. We believe there are 7 layers of heaven above us, or sky, or whatever term you want to call it, and then above everything is Heaven, above the seventh.", "So, while you're going towards each level or layer, the doors will be open, but they will first ask: \"Who is this person?\" And then the name of the believer will mention, and then the doors will open, and they will say: \"Welcome,\" and they will mention the name of the person. So, all of this will happen to the believer.", "Then he will go up, and then after that, he will be sent to his grave, to a life which we call the life of بَرزَخ (Barzakh: intermediate stage between Death and Resurrection). And then the grave of that person will be widened. It will be like a garden for the believer. And a door of Paradise will be open, where the beautiful scent of Paradise will come, and the good deeds of a person will come in the form of a person to keep him company. So they will be rewarded in that Barzakh existence, which will be in the grave.", "Now, what happens to the disbeliever? It's the exact opposite! So the Angel of Death comes, but they will have a group of angels who will have a dirty black cloth with a stinking smell, and then he will be beaten when the soul is taken out of his body, and it will be stretched out. So it will already be a punishment when the soul is just leaving the body, let alone what will happen later! And then they will be taken up, but the doors will not be open. And they will be sent down. And when they're sent down, a door of Hellfire will be opened, and the fire, and the heat, and the smell will come on them. The grave will be tightened on them, that their ribs will change!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Shockingly Describes Life After Death Like You Are Witnessing It! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lePF6KO1aZA", ((179, "2:59–3:26"), (210, "3:30–3:57"), (241, "4:01–4:17"), (261, "4:21–4:43"), (289, "4:49–5:18"),), id: 652)

