#passage(("I would humbly say this: there's a lot of people who would say the same thing; they would say, \"I don't know.\" But there's a difference between \"I don't know\" and \"I do not want to know\". As also there is a difference between \"I don't know\" and \"I live my life\". \"I don't know\" – but when you die, what will happen to you?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Couple Challenge The Islamic Paradigm! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bF9pKdBzqf0", ((188, "3:08–3:20"),), id: 655)
