rist is going to come from. He's going to come from Asfahan, which is actually present-day Iran. And 17,000 Jewish people are going to follow him. There is a lot of Jewish people in Asfahan, in Iran. And it talks about what they're going to be wearing. All of these things are in the future. We have this transcript of life that is telling us how the events are unfolding. And when everything happens, we say that the messenger of Allah spoke the truth. Anything the prophet said that is going to happen, it always will happen. And that gives us a surety.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Curious Couple Ask A Muslim To Explain World Suffering! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9AACeXB0A9Q", ((997, "16:37–17:10"), (1032, "17:12–17:50"), (1080, "18:00–18:34"), (1114, "18:34–19:09"),), id: 673)
