y and get some viewership and get some people listening to what I want to say. There are many people doing this today, and I think we should be careful. And the truth is this: the idea that they're carving stones and been getting ready and prepared, how many times have you heard this? Many, many. They are doing it. But when is it going to happen?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Eddie @TheDeenShowTV Interviews The Muslim Lantern | Masjid Dar Al-Qur'an | Chicago - USA”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sLfJyJGj_eg", ((1478, "24:38–25:38"), (1538, "25:38–25:54"), (1554, "25:54–26:44"), (1604, "26:44–27:25"),), id: 677)

