#passage(("If someone were to have a bad feeling (this is an example), a bad feeling of enmity and hatred, this is completely taken away from your heart in Paradise. Feelings of envy, for instance, because we'd be in different places in Paradise. You can ask the same question now, but not about your family not being in Paradise, but saying that you are going to be in the second level, and I'm in the level 50, for example: \"How am I going to be happy?\"", "And the answer to that is that God will give you contentment in your heart for what you have. He will also give you the acceptance of His justice. If I know someone wasn't deserving of being in Paradise because they lived an unrighteous life, they didn't believe in the Creator, they disobeyed Him, they lived their life without giving any gratitude to Allah, any recognition to God, and then they ended up in Hellfire, then I know it's from the justice of Allah for them to end up there, and I will accept that and be content with the justice of Allah. Also, I'll be very busy and occupied by the amount of pleasures that are never-ending and are going to be in Paradise. You don't have time to be upset or sad.", "People are going to be happy in Paradise. Many verses in the Quran talks about us being happy.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Shockingly Describes Life After Death Like You Are Witnessing It! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lePF6KO1aZA", ((542, "9:02–9:24"), (570, "9:30–10:12"), (625, "10:25–10:26"),), id: 688)
