#passage(("They are all martyrs. Allah tells us in the Quran (alImran3:169): وَلَا تَحْسَبَنَّ الَّذِينَ قُتِلُوا فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ أَمْوَاتًا (Do not think those who were killed in the path of God are dead) بَلْ أَحْيَاءٌ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ يُرْزَقُونَ (They are alive, being provided for with their Lord). THEY ARE NOT DEAD. If anyone is DEAD, it's those people who do evil to them. They are DEAD inside, and they will be DEAD in the grave. But those people who die for the sake of God upon the Truth, these are NOT DEAD.", "Allah says فَرِحِينَ (they're happy) (alImran3:170) بِمَا آتَاهُمُ اللَّهُ (With what Allahﷻ has given them). What they have, we cannot even imagine. The martyr, from the minute he dies, he's straight away in Paradise. We cannot even imagine the goodness, the happiness, and the great rewards that they are experiencing. So, they are WINNERS when it comes to true winning, which is winning your place in the Afterlife.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Emotional Shahada | Peruvian Sister Discovers The Truth Of Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PZDTz4a-nZA", ((1554, "25:54–26:27"), (1592, "26:32–26:55"),), id: 690)
