#passage(("It’s an actual punishment, though. That will happen, that the people deserve and the people will get, well deserved for them disobeying the Creator after knowing this is the Truth. Because Allah says He will make it clear: \"We’ll show them our signs in the horizon and within themselves until it’s clear to them that is the truth\", Allah says in the Quran41:53. So, people will know it is the Truth. When they reject it and die upon rejecting it, they're not going to be complaining in Hellfire.", "They will be asked in the Hellfire: “Didn’t they come to you our Messengers from among you, giving you my signs and telling you the evidences?”. They would say yes, but we didn't listen, we didn’t use our intellect, we didn't obey. (Quran67:8-11) And Allah says if they were to be returned, they will come back to disobeying Allah again, even after all of this, after going to the Hellfire. They will be asking “Oh, Allah return us, we’ll do good” Quran32:12. Allah says even if they were returned, they will come back to what they used to do, and they are liars. Quran6:28", "Once you enter Hellfire, there’s no going out. That’s what the Quran says. There are many verses in the Quran. I’ll give you one verse (Quran5:37) يُرِيدُونَ أَن يَخْرُجُوا۟ مِنَ ٱلنَّارِ وَمَا هُم بِخَـٰرِجِينَ مِنْهَا ۖ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌۭ مُّقِيمٌۭ: They want to exit the Fire and they will not exit the fire, and they will have a resident punishment in it.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Arab Christian Introduced To The Challenge Of The Quran! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n-flvFktgzU", ((1123, "18:43–19:04"), (1148, "19:08–19:32"), (1178, "19:38–19:52"),), id: 700)
