oesn't tell us exactly how many years or thousands or millions; you don't know. So this is the justice of being purified from the sins that you've been committing first.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Ladies Discover The True Identity Of Jesus! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ytiIPe7Dmho", ((1487, "24:47–25:02"), (1536, "25:36–26:02"), (1562, "26:02–26:28"), (1588, "26:28–27:01"), (1626, "27:06–27:28"),), id: 707)
