o don't believe only, for those who commit that crime that I told you.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Presents A Logical Problem With Hellfire In Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WaGhbcZK2Cc", ((168, "2:48–2:56"), (200, "3:20–4:01"), (243, "4:03–4:34"), (274, "4:34–5:14"),), id: 709)
