#passage(("Testify that Allahﷻ is the only Lord worthy of worship and Prophet Muhammadﷺ is His Messenger. You do something which we refer to as a Shahada. Shahada is a Testimony of Faith. We believe you will be amongst the losers in the Hereafter if you don't testify that. If you don't believe it in your heart and testify it with your tongue, nothing will save you. That's what we believe.", "That testimony of Faith is to testify that there is nothing worthy of worship except Allah. That's the beginning. But the most important thing is the beginning part: to testify nothing is worthy of worship. Worship to us is a very big concept. It's not just prayer but everything that you do for the sake of the Creator. So you testify there is nothing worthy of worship except Allahﷻ and you believe it in your heart. You testify that Prophet Muhammadﷺ is the last and final Messenger and a slave of God amongst many different Messengers of God. And you follow that Message that he came with.", "Now, we believe that for you, you need to have Iman, what we call Iman. And Iman, you need three things. Iman means Faith. N°1 you need to do is to believe in your heart with what I was saying, that Allah is the only One worthy of worship, Prophet Muhammadﷺ is His last and final Messenger. Then N°2 you need to say it with your tongue. Testify the testimony of Truth with your tongue and your speech. And then you need to do the actions. These 3 things have to be in place in order for someone to enter Paradise, to have Iman, and to have Faith.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Inquisitive Christian Learns About Islam P1! Muhammed Ali - Speakers Corner”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bJOB7cYkp-I", ((420, "7:00–7:58"), (482, "8:02–8:28"), (514, "8:34–9:02"),), id: 719)
