#passage(("There's a condition for people to be punished in Islam. Condition is: get the message of Islam, the message of the truth, the clear message. And then you will know deep down is the truth, because he will answer your [concerns]; it will be logical, rational, consistent. You will know deep down is the truth, and based on that you would reject it. If you reject it and you die upon rejecting it, then you go to Hell Fire.", "Now, when do you die? No one knows. Anyone can die anytime. Every single person that exist has a separate, different test than other person. My test is different than his test, than your test, than everyone test. Everyone test as individual to them, to their capacity. Allah Knows Your Capacity, and he say he doesn't overwhelm you more than you can handle.", "Question is: if you knew Islam was the truth and got the message, why are you waiting? What keeping you off disobeying the Creator?", "We have something which we call the [fitrah], an innate disposition that we're born with. That innate disposition knows the Creator, recognizes the Creator. We're born believing in a Creator, and we know the truth deep down with that, but it's covered by Society, by Family, Etc. When someone tells you the truth — Allah will put someone in your path — he will make sense to you.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “University Students Surprise Muslim With Difficult Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FTEkpj70bQ0", ((1039, "17:19–17:45"), (1065, "17:45–18:04"), (1085, "18:05–18:12"), (1164, "19:24–19:48"),), id: 760)
