#passage(("Allah says in the Quran41:53, سَنُرِيهِمْ ءَايَـٰتِنَا فِى ٱلْـَٔافَاقِ وَفِىٓ أَنفُسِهِمْ حَتَّىٰ يَتَبَيَّنَ لَهُمْ أَنَّهُ ٱلْحَقُّ ۗ We’ll show them our signs within the Horizon and within themselves until it's clear to them that this is the Truth. So everyone will have an opportunity.", "So it all depends on that: whether the person is sincere to accept, after God shows him the Truth. Because he will have a chance where the Truth is shown to him, he will have a chance where things are clarified. He will come across the situations where his questions are answered, people are offering him, to invite him to Islam, or to give him a Quran, or to speak to him about God, or to answer his questions. Muslims are very welcoming when it comes to talking about Islam. Muslims have various channels on YouTube, they're answering people's questions, engaging with non-Muslims on a daily basis. So we are out there, we're trying to say the Truth to everyone. So the Truth is there. Everyone has a chance to hear the Truth and listen to the Truth.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Challenges Muslim On Biblical Authority! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_1T5OxDHRWA", ((185, "3:05–3:13"), (205, "3:25–4:04"),), id: 765)
