#passage(("The best thing I can tell you, to save you from the trouble of this question, is to understand you and me are not the one who judges; God is the one who judges. Allah knows to what extent the person has encounter the truth and heard the message or not. It's not for me to judge at all, because we can give just General statements with general rules. If you encounter the message and reject and die, you go to Hellfire: general rule. If you don't encounter the message at all, you have a different test in the day of judgment.", "Now what is in between, to what extent the person encountered the message, God knows the heart. He knows how much effort the person put, he knows how much information he's encountered in his life, he knows everything. That's what makes Allah the judge, and that's what makes him the most just. I can never take that role; no human being can, cuz I don't know your experience, but he knows everything in your heart.", "Many scholars talk about that: if you get a corrupted idea, you're not getting the message, because Islam is not a religion where you Slaughter everyone; that's not Islam. So whatever the media is pushing is not Islam, so they have yet to get the message. And that's why Allah, when he talks about The Messengers and Prophets, he says it's only upon the messenger clear delivery.", "And also, another thing to keep in mind: it's always best to bring someone who is more eloquent, more knowledgeable, Etc, can deliver in a better way. But what I was telling your friend, for example, this is what the message is: that there is another messenger that was sent by God. He came with the same messages of the previous Messengers, called To Worship God Alone. He said that you have to believe in all of these Messengers as well. He said that nobody should be worship except God, and Jesus said the same thing. And he wouldn't do any of this except for God; makes no sense for him to do this for anything else. And he was in a line of other Messengers, and you believe in other Messengers. Why you stop and you don't believe in Prophet Muhammad? Why stop there?", "So that message: that there was another messenger sent, the Quran of course, which is the essence of the message, which is God's speech to them. So if they take the Quran and read it, they have the message delivered; the whole message is delivered to them, if they understand there's another messenger that was sent and you need to investigate and read and see. So whatever someone is telling you, \"God sent you someone else\", the creator of the universe sending you someone else and he sending you new instructions, don't just say \"oh whatever\" and then live my life. I have to take that seriously, because he is the one who created me and created everyone.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim and Christian Sisters Enquire About Hellfire In Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7sdgLSIwzHQ", ((1451, "24:11–24:37"), (1477, "24:37–24:59"), (1520, "25:20–25:42"), (1553, "25:53–26:36"), (1596, "26:36–27:10"),), id: 766)
