#passage(("It depends what you mean by Christian. We Believe, for example, if you're living out the time with Jesus and follow Jesus, then that's not what a Christian is; that's a Muslim. So the people who followed Jesus at his life, before Prophet Muhammad, and followed the teachings of Jesus and died upon that, these people go to paradise. You can call them Christians; today many people will call them Christians.", "Now, after Prophet Muhammad, this is the condition: whoever hears The Message of Islam and reject The Message of Islam and dies upon rejecting it will go to Hell Fire. Who doesn't hear the message, and he call himself Christian, but he didn't hear the message of Islam, he didn't hear the evidences for his truth, has a different test on the day of judgment. The criteria is: if you hear the truth, the [evidences presented] to you, and then you reject it and you die upon rejecting it, then you're choosing Hellfire, because you see the evidences and innately you know is the truth, cuz it will make sense.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Man Grills Muslim With Difficult Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-rSkeAMTyK0", ((592, "9:52–10:25"), (625, "10:25–10:55"),), id: 770)
// U ML098:709-868 | The Muslim Lantern | 17
#passage(("This video really, really frustrates me. It honestly does, more than the videos that you see done by those liars, non-Muslims, because what do you expect? You expect from a non-Muslim to be a liar. But in this case, it's extremely frustrating and annoying when you have people who are so ignorant and arrogant to sit down like this, and spreading nonsense to millions of people. It's honestly mind-blowing.", "And this is the problem: the big problem is the fact that everybody thinks they can talk about Religion. Everybody thinks they can be an expert about Religion. Anybody can talk about Religion, you don't need a formal education, you don't need to go to school, you don't need to do any of that. For you to be a doctor? Oh, of course, you need to go study! Oh, to be an engineer? Oh, you need years. But talk about God and Religion and Islam? Oh, talk, say whatever you want. It's honestly frustrating.", "It's very easy to debunk this nonsense. I don't know of Muslims who don't know that Disbelievers, including Jews and Christians, if they die as disbelievers, they explicitly go to the Hellfire. You need now to deal with this nonsense and respond to this nonsense.", "She says that Allah addresses the believers in the Quran, but He doesn't address the Muslims in the Quran; He doesn't say: \"Ōh, Muslims\". What a stupid argument to make!", "Allah explicitly says in the Quran (alimran3:19) إِنَّ ٱلدِّینَ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ ٱلۡإِسۡلَـٰمُۗ (That the only religion accepted in the sight of God is Islam). Allah says (alimran3:85) وَمَن یَبۡتَغِ غَیۡرَ ٱلۡإِسۡلَـٰمِ دِینࣰا فَلَن یُقۡبَلَ مِنۡهُ (Whoever seeks any other religion other than Islam) – so Islam is a specific Religion – then Allah says: (Whoever seeks any other Religion other than Islam) فَلَن یُقۡبَلَ مِنۡهُ وَهُوَ فِی ٱلۡـَٔاخِرَةِ مِنَ ٱلۡخَـٰسِرِینَ (It is not going to be accepted from him) (And then he will be from the losers in the Afterlife). Explicitly clear, mentioned in the Quran.", "Allah in the Quran talks about the Jews and the Christians, and He says explicitly everywhere in the Quran: لَّقَدۡ كَفَرَ ٱلَّذِینَ قَالُوۤا۟ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ ثَالِثُ ثَلَـٰثَةࣲۘ (alMaida5:73) لَّقَدۡ كَفَرَ ٱلَّذِینَ قَالُوۤا۟ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ ٱلۡمَسِیحُ ٱبۡنُ مَرۡیَمَۚ (alMaida5:17) (Those who say that Allah is three in one) or (Those who say that Jesus is God or the son of God) or any of that have committed DISBELIEF. Explicit verses in the Quran.", "And then Allah says (anNisa4:56) (Those who disbelieve, We will make them taste the fire..) (that every time their skin are roasted, we'll replace them with another skin).", "And then you get an idiot and comes and tells you: \"Do you believe they're going to Paradise?\" \"Yes, I do believe.\" Do you think it's your back door? You're going to let in who you like, and you're going to close the door on who you don't like?", "Then she says, Allah in the Quran always addresses the Believers. Ok, so what does Allah say to the Believers? For instance, Allahﷻ ('Azza wa jal: Almighty and Majestic is God) says in the Quran (alimran3:102) یَـٰۤأَیُّهَا ٱلَّذِینَ ءَامَنُوا۟ (Ō you who believe) ٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ حَقَّ تُقَاتِهِۦ (Fear God or be conscious of God) وَلَا تَمُوتُنَّ إِلَّا وَأَنْتُمْ مُسْلِمُونَ (Do not die except as Muslims). So Allah addresses the Believers, yes. But what does He tell them? He tells them to die as Muslims. He doesn't tell them to die as Christians.", "And she will come and say, oh, but Muslim – which, by the way, is the linguistic definition of the word. Islam and Muslim is a linguistic definition. Then we have an Islamic definition, or a شرعي Shar'i definition, or a technical definition. So the linguistic definition is your submission to God and being a submitter, but the technical definition is to believe in the 5 pillars, in 6 articles of Faith, etc.", "And there is a clear difference between the word Muslim in the Quran, and between Jews and Christians. For instance, what does the Quran say? The Quran says (alimran3:64) (Say Ō People of the Book, come to common terms between us and you) (To worship Allah alone and not to associate partners with Allah). And then Allah says: (If they turn away from you -the people of the Book- then say we are Muslims)! So there is a difference now between us, who will say we are Muslims, and the People of the Book, who are not coming to common terms with us. So there is a difference between Muslims and non-Muslims, the People of the Book and the Believers. There is a clear difference.", "Who are the believers, for example? Because she lied and said \"the believer is not the one who prays..\" No! These are the believers. Allah says: (The believers are the ones who believe in Allah and His Messenger) إِنَّمَا ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنُونَ ٱلَّذِینَ ءَامَنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ (alHujurat49:15). So those who believe in Allah and Prophet Muhammad are the Believers. So if you don't believe in Allah and Prophet Muhammad, you're not a Believer.", "I can go on and on; this is one of the basic foundations of Islam, where there's so much evidence that I can bring. But even about entering Paradise, Allahﷻ says in the Quran, for instance: یَـٰعِبَادِ لَا خَوۡفٌ عَلَیۡكُمُ ٱلۡیَوۡمَ وَلَاۤ أَنتُمۡ تَحۡزَنُونَ (azZukhruf43:68-70) (Ō my servants, there's no fear on you today -i.e. in the Day of Judgment- and you will not grieve). Then Allah says: (Those who believe) – who are the ones who believe? Again, we come to Believers – and (those who believe in our verses) ٱلَّذِینَ ءَامَنُوا۟ بِـَٔایَـٰتِنَا وَكَانُوا۟ مُسۡلِمِینَ (And they were Muslims).", "So who are those who have no fear and they will not grieve? Those who believe in the verses of Allah and they were Muslims. Which verses of Allah are these, if it's not the Quran? And then it says: (enter Janna (Paradise)). So here, who enters Jannah? (You and your wives)? Who enter Jannah? The believers are the ones who enter Jannah. And anyways, the Prophetﷺ explicitly says that (no Jew or Christian will hear about me, and not believe in that which I was sent with) (except that he enters the Hellfire).", "It's really dangerous! Why does this frustrate me more than other things? Because when they see a woman like this putting a headscarf on, I'm not going to say a full Hijab (veil), wearing jeans or whatever, but putting a headscarf on, which they think is a Hijab, and they think she represents the Islamic community. And then millions of people watch: \"Oh, we're going to Paradise\"!", "Why do we need to invite Christians to Islam then? Why did the Prophetﷺ speak to the Christians of Najran? What's the point? According to you, they're going to Paradise. Why talk to them then? What's the point of Da'wah anyways? Why do we invite them? Why do we invite anyone to the Religion? Why do they need to convert, to change their Faith? I believe one person was even commenting, \"Then why do I need to convert?\" Such a valid question! Why do you need to convert then, if you're going to Paradise as a Christian? Complete nonsense!", "And all of that is to liberalise, so you don't get people having bad feeling in their heart when you tell them that disbelievers are going to Hellfire. But those same people, they say you're going to Hellfire! The Christians say: if you don't believe in Jesus Christ as your Lord and Savior, you're going to Hellfire! (John3:36) So why this stupid liberal game, to just make them pleased with you and compromising your own Faith, and explicitly lying and pretending like they're going to go to Paradise!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| 5 Reasons I Left Islam?! Hijabi Says Christians Will Go To Heaven?! | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wIhGWmIQTJY", ((2420, "40:20–40:51"), (2453, "40:53–41:16"), (2480, "41:20–41:33"), (2496, "41:36–41:42"), (2506, "41:46–42:11"), (2533, "42:13–42:33"), (2555, "42:35–42:40"), (2572, "42:52–43:04"), (2588, "43:08–43:31"), (2613, "43:33–43:49"), (2634, "43:54–44:30"), (2672, "44:32–44:49"), (2693, "44:53–45:19"), (2724, "45:24–45:53"), (2757, "45:57–46:15"), (2779, "46:19–46:45"), (2806, "46:46–47:06"),), id: 771)
