#passage(("If Prophet Muhammad is a Messenger of God, the Quran is from God, and you believe the Quran is preserved (that's a historical fact anyways), Quran is preserved the same way. Allah, God, revealed to a Messenger of His, Prophet Muhammad peace be upon himﷺ, a Message, i.e. the Quran, and He gave him a Revelation to teach the people of how to understand the Quran and how to practice it. Did the Prophetﷺ and does Allah in the Quran tell us to do Hajj, perform Pilgrimage? Is that a command from Allah, based on what we just established, that this is Allah's, God's, command? If it's given to Muhammad and Muhammed says you should do that, then you do that!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Does Islam Contain Pagan Teachings? Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0L6bTixTAd4", ((95, "1:35–2:11"),), id: 793)
