#passage(("If you pray to God, you should pray to God the way that God wants you to pray to Him. For example, God says for us, when we pray, we put this hand, the right hand, on top of the left hand, and we say these specific words, \"Allah Akbar\" (God is Greater), and we recite the first Chapter of the Quran (alFatiha). If God says it's appropriate you pray this way as a man, appropriate you pray this way as a woman, therefore, this is how we have to pray.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Lady Questions Muslim On Evidence Of God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nk4EM0u0VNs", ((900, "15:00–15:27"),), id: 806)
