#passage(("We can pray in public. In fact, the prophet Muhammad, he said: I was given six virtues over the other Messengers, or the other prophets. So he had specific six characteristics the other Messengers did not receive from the Creator. One of them is, he said, the Earth was made as a mosque for me. So the whole Earth was made as a place of prayer for me. So as long as I find a clean place that does not have anything dirty in it, I can pray in it as a Muslim. Would I concern myself what the Bible teaches about prayer? I'm not a Christian.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Preachers Ambush Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kyGNAxTCD9c", ((711, "11:51–12:32"),), id: 807)
