#passage(("There are multiple evidences that Prophet Muhammad is a Prophet. So we established that Islam, unlike Christianity and other religions, is not based on blind faith; it's based on proof. So now, if we agree that Islam is from God, then if God told me to pray in Japanese, I'll pray in Japanese. If God told me to pray in Russian, I'll learn Russian.", "Allah is not saying learn the Arabic language! \"You're not a true Muslim until you learn the Arabic language\", no! There are certain things that can only be done in Arabic, which is the prayer, because the Quran is only God's speech in Arabic. If you translate it, it's not God's speech, it's a translation of God's speech. So if you pray, you speak to God, reciting the Quran, reciting His speech, so it has to be done in the original language. But that's only the prayer.", "It's not a necessary thing for someone to learn the Arabic language to become a Muslim. Over 80% of Muslims are non-Arabs! Someone is commenting, saying \"It took me three days to learn the prayer\". It's not a difficult thing for someone to learn. If you put some effort and time, you can!", "Allah says in the Quran (alAnbiya21:107) (Prophet Muhammad is sent as a MERCY to the mankind), all of mankind. The Prophet said (alA'raf7:158) إِنِّى رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ إِلَيْكُمْ جَمِيعًا (I'm the Messenger of God to ALL of you). Not just Arabs or non-Arabs, everyone. So God knows everything.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Wife Grills A Muslim With Difficult Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tUX4xfgST_E", ((2085, "34:45–35:02"), (2127, "35:27–35:50"), (2152, "35:52–36:08"), (2188, "36:28–36:42"),), id: 808)
