// U ML222:261-312 | The Muslim Lantern | 2
#passage(("Do you know how you stop doing bad things? Do you know how to get the willingness and the energy and the power and the feeling you want to change? How do you get it? By starting by doing good. Who prays and doesn't do any bad things? Name one person. If you find him, I'll say okay.", "Allah says that who believes and does righteous [deeds], will make him live a good life, because he's obeying God. And good life doesn't mean money only; good life means that you'll be content. You can go to Africa and you find someone who Smiles every day and is happier than you'll ever be, because he's content; he's happy enough with what he has. So this can only be given by God. So Allah will give this good life to the person who is good person, obeying God. He will give contentment and peace. Even if you lose everything, you'll be content, because you have God. The person who doesn't believe in God: money is everything; women is their God, money is their God.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Surprises A French Man Looking For Answers! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=piz443ivKUc", ((514, "8:34–9:19"), (588, "9:48–10:24"),), id: 827)
